  "srt_preview": "1\n00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500\nDetik ini juga, cabut sumbat\n\n2\n00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:05,000\nraksasa Bumi dan kuras habis\n\n3\n00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,500\nseluruh samudra dalam sekejap mata.\n\n4\n00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,000\nPerahu kayu Pak Teguh tidak\n\n5\n00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,500\ntenggelam, melainkan mendarat mulus di\n\n6\n00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,000\nhamparan lumpur asin tanpa setetes\n\n7\n00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,000\nombak pun.\n\n8\n00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,571\nApa yang sebenarnya terjadi jika\n\n9\n00:00:18,571 --> 00:00:21,143\nseluruh laut Bumi menghilang? Kita\n\n10\n00:00:21,143 --> 00:00:23,714\nbaru saja melenyapkan satu koma\n\n11\n00:00:23,714 --> 00:00:26,286\ntiga ratus tiga puluh dua\n\n12\n00:00:26,286 --> 00:00:28,857\nmiliar kilometer kubik air asin,\n\n13\n00:00:28,857 --> 00:00:31,429\natau sekitar sembilan puluh tujuh\n\n14\n00:00:31,429 --> 00:00:34,000\npersen cadangan air planet ini.\n\n15\n00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,857\nBegitu air surut, tepi pantai\n\n16\n00:00:36,857 --> 00:00:39,714\nberubah menjadi jurang landas kontinen\n\n17\n00:00:39,714 --> 00:00:42,571\nsetinggi gedung pencakar langit. Kapal\n\n18\n00:00:42,571 --> 00:00:45,429\nkargo yang tadinya mengapung kini\n\n19\n00:00:45,429 --> 00:00:48,286\nbertengger di bibir tebing curam\n\n20\n00:00:48,286 --> 00:00:51,143\nsedalam empat kilometer menuju dataran\n\n21\n00:00:51,143 --> 00:00:54,000\nabisal yang gelap dan berdebu.\n\n22\n00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,308\nDi dasar Pasifik, menganga Palung\n\n23\n00:00:56,308 --> 00:00:58,615\nMariana sedalam hampir sebelas kilometer,\n\n24\n00:00:58,615 --> 00:01:00,923\nlebih tinggi dari Gunung Everest\n\n25\n00:01:00,923 --> 00:01:03,231\njika dibalik. Sementara di tengah\n\n26\n00:01:03,231 --> 00:01:05,538\nsamudra, punggungan gunung api bawah\n\n27\n00:01:05,538 --> 00:01:07,846\nlaut sepanjang enam puluh lima\n\n28\n00:01:07,846 --> 00:01:10,154\nribu kilometer langsung menyemburkan asap\n\n29\n00:01:10,154 --> 00:01:12,000\nbelerang ke udara terbuka.\n\n30\n00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:14,778\nBencana sesungguhnya justru dimulai di\n\n31\n00:01:14,778 --> 00:01:17,556\nlangit. Lebih dari delapan puluh\n\n32\n00:01:17,556 --> 00:01:20,333\nlima persen uap air pembentuk\n\n33\n00:01:20,333 --> 00:01:23,111\nawan berasal dari penguapan laut.\n\n34\n00:01:23,111 --> 00:01:25,889\nTanpa samudra, pabrik hujan global\n\n35\n00:01:25,889 --> 00:01:28,667\ntutup total, awan memudar dalam\n\n36\n00:01:28,667 --> 00:01:31,444\nhitungan hari, dan sungai besar\n\n37\n00:01:31,444 --> 00:01:32,000\nmengering.\n\n38\n00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:34,703\nSamudra juga bekerja sebagai penyangga\n\n39\n00:01:34,703 --> 00:01:37,405\npanas raksasa yang menyerap sembilan\n\n40\n00:01:37,405 --> 00:01:40,108\npuluh persen kelebihan kalor Bumi\n\n41\n00:01:40,108 --> 00:01:42,811\ndan membagikannya lewat arus termal.\n\n42\n00:01:42,811 --> 00:01:45,514\nTanpa selimut air ini, siang\n\n43\n00:01:45,514 --> 00:01:48,216\nhari memanggang benua secara ekstrem,\n\n44\n00:01:48,216 --> 00:01:50,919\nsedangkan malam hari anjlok membeku\n\n45\n00:01:50,919 --> 00:01:52,000\nseperti gurun.\n\n46\n00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:54,571\nDi lapisan permukaan yang lenyap\n\n47\n00:01:54,571 --> 00:01:57,143\ntadi, miliaran fitoplankton mikroskopis tadinya\n\n48\n00:01:57,143 --> 00:01:59,714\nmemproduksi sekitar separuh oksigen Bumi\n\n49\n00:01:59,714 --> 00:02:02,286\nsekaligus mengunci karbon dioksida. Saat\n\n50\n00:02:02,286 --> 00:02:04,857\nhamparan lumpur organik di dasar\n\n51\n00:02:04,857 --> 00:02:07,429\nlaut mengering dan membusuk, gas\n\n52\n00:02:07,429 --> 00:02:10,000\nkarbon terlepas deras ke atmosfer.\n\n53\n00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,571\nMari urutkan garis waktunya. Hari\n\n54\n00:02:12,571 --> 00:02:15,143\npertama, pelabuhan lumpuh dan badai\n\n55\n00:02:15,143 --> 00:02:17,714\ndebu garam menyapu pesisir. Bulan\n\n56\n00:02:17,714 --> 00:02:20,286\npertama, gagal panen melanda seluruh\n\n57\n00:02:20,286 --> 00:02:22,857\nbenua karena hujan berhenti. Dalam\n\n58\n00:02:22,857 --> 00:02:25,429\nhitungan dekade, hutan hujan mengering\n\n59\n00:02:25,429 --> 00:02:28,000\ndan memicu kebakaran lintas benua.\n\n60\n00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:30,424\nHanya kantong kecil kehidupan di\n\n61\n00:02:30,424 --> 00:02:32,848\nsekitar cadangan air tanah dalam\n\n62\n00:02:32,848 --> 00:02:35,273\ndan kutub es yang sempat\n\n63\n00:02:35,273 --> 00:02:37,697\nbertahan sementara. Selebihnya, kerak samudra\n\n64\n00:02:37,697 --> 00:02:40,121\nyang kehilangan beban triliunan ton\n\n65\n00:02:40,121 --> 00:02:42,545\nair mulai memantul naik dan\n\n66\n00:02:42,545 --> 00:02:44,000\nmengguncang lempeng tektonik.\n\n67\n00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:47,077\nTernyata laut bukan sekadar genangan\n\n68\n00:02:47,077 --> 00:02:50,154\ntempat berlayar, melainkan pengatur napas,\n\n69\n00:02:50,154 --> 00:02:53,231\nsuhu, dan hujan bagi setiap\n\n70\n00:02:53,231 --> 00:02:56,308\nmakhluk darat. Untungnya, samudra kita\n\n71\n00:02:56,308 --> 00:02:59,385\nmasih utuh menjaga Bumi hari\n\n72\n00:02:59,385 --> 00:03:00,000\nini.\n"
